{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_033_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a91018fda61fd58a8010aaea7c027eb6dbaa6181d6d8ad1f72522d33e05c2138",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed3fad4069cd300e6cdaef552673c55eb25217e21adc3c1286b12dea3288f5e9",
      "text": "（虽然直到今天探听了各种情况，\n但花音、直央和制作人都和平常一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21fa4030054a631ae63e70c2c59560f72688bff0eb3e3b6d9aa35c28c4ecc186",
      "text": "（看起来也不像是在准备什么……\n难道我的生日会真的没有吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3dea10a2da6d4a421257488a8017512180fd3b8b78d893b955bd997051f25e",
      "text": "……咦、奇怪！？刚才的动作跳错了吗？\n抱歉两位，再让我跳一次……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000087:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4896e36dfcb04dbbcf6573ceb9da2b3bccc3e93b4d92267b5451e59ecc805879",
      "text": "舞蹈练习结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb5264ca0fff52b71b57009ea7e63153dbfa04d7aa4a8f62adda128bf28bdbf0",
      "text": "（哈啊……\n真逊啊，我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f32afe75c35628d1e277232447ee9d46671e823ec2243adb835863c95e805735",
      "text": "志狼君。自主练习虽好，\n不过差不多该收工了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33dfe03aab8bb84d9ad369bd416eb3c39d91e3874a6dec8315d46959e966c352",
      "text": "志狼君。今天的舞蹈练习怎么啦？\n明明直到昨天都还超级有干劲的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:091b614fd2e81091e87f0f6db6453f74ab900854a36bc4f02a9d6c48acbe74ee",
      "text": "难道是哪里身体不舒服吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6c9c99c5e01c48197445beb72576a01a6254d2fb21a991c3e883ed0bf5761c7",
      "text": "没……\n并没有啦，我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c70ba71c5a09c202e37c7b39d7570bc7cb7e834f2ccbaa8ffe433ec3c8222649",
      "text": "怎么办……虽然原本打算接下来给志狼君\n办生日会的，要改天吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22a0fca70be858754f108df639751fb49d9409890f7177eb6c72028d3dfaaedc",
      "text": "……诶！？\n果然还是有的嘛，我的生日会！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
